---
// 20 cases, 3 evidence rows each. Query counts and milliseconds are from the
// /lazy and /eager captures in the post (in-process SQLite).
const W = 900, H = 340;
---
<figure class="bep5e">
  <div class="bep5e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Top row: lazy loading sends 1 query for the cases then 20 separate evidence queries, 21 in total. Middle row: selectinload sends 2 queries. Bottom: timings for 20 and 200 cases.">
    <text x="40" y="30" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>lazy: 1 + N = 21 queries for 20 cases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lazy: 1 + N = 21 query cho 20 case</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="46" width="90" height="34" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="85" y="68" text-anchor="middle" class="sub mono">cases</text>
    {Array.from({ length: 20 }, (_, i) => (
      <rect x={140 + i * 34} y="46" width="28" height="34" rx="4" class="bad" />
    ))}
    <text x="40" y="104" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>red: one SELECT evidence per case, sent while the loop runs</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đỏ: mỗi case một SELECT evidence, bắn ra trong lúc vòng lặp chạy</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="40" y="160" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>selectinload: 2 queries, any N</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>selectinload: 2 query, N bao nhiêu cũng vậy</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="40" y="176" width="90" height="34" rx="6" class="box" />
    <text x="85" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="sub mono">cases</text>
    <rect x="140" y="176" width="260" height="34" rx="6" class="good" />
    <text x="270" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="sub mono">evidence WHERE case_id IN (…)</text>

    <text x="40" y="262" class="nm">
      <tspan data-lang-en>20 cases: 21 vs 2 queries · 4.0 ms vs 1.5 ms</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>20 case: 21 vs 2 query · 4.0 ms vs 1.5 ms</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="40" y="286" class="nm">
      <tspan data-lang-en>200 cases: 201 vs 2 queries · 31.7 ms vs 4.3 ms</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>200 case: 201 vs 2 query · 31.7 ms vs 4.3 ms</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="40" y="312" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>SQLite runs inside the process: each extra query costs microseconds, not a network round trip</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>SQLite chạy ngay trong process: mỗi query thêm tốn micro giây, chưa có round trip qua mạng</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The N+1 grows with the page size, not with anything you can see in the endpoint code. Against a networked database the same 200 extra queries each add a round trip.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>N+1 lớn lên theo kích thước trang, không theo thứ gì nhìn thấy trong code endpoint. Với database qua mạng, 200 query dư đó mỗi cái cộng thêm một round trip.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5e text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5e .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep5e .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5e .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5e .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5e .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5e .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep5e .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5e .badfill { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5e .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5e .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5e .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5e .goodt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
